   "description": "The gravel pit Razkrižje is one of the smallest districts in our fishing environment. It is visited mostly by local fishermen. It is 2 ha big and is home to pikes, carps, common breams,roaches, percoidei and common rudds. You can find this gravel pit on the road from Razkrižje to Srednja Bistrica ( on the right side of the road)."
