   "subtitle": "Golnik, Siget, Mala jama",
   "description": "The district consists of 4 gravel pits and the fishing regime is marked on boards. The big gravel pit Golnik is meant for fishing of carps using ground fishing technique and the fishing places are arranged accordingly. The gravel pit Siget is meant for fishermen who love to float fish. The fishing is allowed with 2 rods. The little sports cave is meant for competitions."
